               <h1 class="orange">Oops! The page you're looking for doesn't exist.</h1>
               
               <p>Either we broke something, or you might have typed the address incorrectly. If you
                  check the URL, or try our search tool, you might find what you're looking for.</p>
               
               <form class="input-group input-group-lg bottom30 top30" action="/search/"><label class="sr-only" for="404-searchterm">Search</label> <span class="input-group-addon"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-search"></span></span> <input id="q" class="form-control" title="search" name="q" type="text" placeholder="Search..."> <span class="input-group-addon"><input id="submit" name="submit" type="submit" value="Go!"> </span></form>
               
               <p>If you think you received this error by mistake, please report the broken link to
                  our web master at <a href="mailto:webmaster@cobleskill.edu">webmaster@cobleskill.edu</a>.</p>
               
